{"articleNo":"1677","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1677&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011년 대장경천년세계문화축전 자원봉사자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.29","hit":"8616","attachments":[{"name":"자원봉사자 모집 요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1677&attachNo=70917"},{"name":"자원봉사신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1677&attachNo=71331"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">2011년 대장경천년세계문화축전 자원봉사자 모집 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">1. 축전개요</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 행사기간 : 2011. 09. 23(금) ~ 2011. 11. 06(일), 45일간</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 개최장소 : 경상남도 합천군 가야면 주행사장, 해인사 일원</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">2. 접수기간 : 2011. 03. 23 ~ 2011. 05. 20(2개월)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">3. 신청자격 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 공고일 현재 만18세 이상의 대한민국 국민, 해외동포,&nbsp;국내&nbsp; 거주 외국인</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 행사기간 중 10일 이상 근무 가능한 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 출, 퇴근 가능한 자(차량지원 불가)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">4. 제출서류</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 자원봉사 참가신청서 1부(소정양식)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 외국어시험 성적증명서 및 국제행사 참여증서 사본 각1부(해당자에 한함)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"4\">5. 문의 : 대장경천년세계문화축전 행사전시운영팀<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(055-211-6263~7)<br>6. 기타자세한사항은 붙임참조<br><br>붙임&nbsp; 1. 자원봉사자 모집 요강&nbsp; 1부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 자원봉사신청서&nbsp; 1부.&nbsp;&nbsp; 끝.<br><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학&nbsp;&nbsp; 생&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;처&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2011. 03. 29. </font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
